      "termsOfService": "We come to the house, look at the actual work, and give a written estimate before any job is scheduled. The estimate is firm. Diagnostic visits include most minor on-the-spot repairs; major repairs (panel upgrades, sub-panel installs, full circuit re-runs) get a separate written estimate before work begins."
